+\subsection{Motivation and Challenges}
+
+The mechanisms above provide a basis for workflow-aware recovery.
+Allocating finite protection resources also requires addressing two
+limitations of the decision criteria. We examine these limitations using
+agent execution traces and measured KV readiness costs. The traces
+characterize branch timing; the model measurements quantify reconstruction
+and reuse under a common endpoint. Together they motivate two requirements
+for workflow-aware protection.
 
